WEBVTT

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.290
Chocola.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.080
Whenever you're ready.

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:13.330
There we are.

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:16.580
Did Master arrive at his destination already?

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:20.700
The strawberry farm he is going to
is quite far away, so I doubt it.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.290
Let's hope he gets lots
of delicious strawberries!

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:27.450
Master's judgement and
business skills are put to the test.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.080
We're back!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:33.120
We got lots of stuff.
We're ready for anything.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:37.870
Meat croquette, pumpkin croquette,
and crab cream croquette.

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:40.410
Why so many croquettes...?

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:43.410
The store was really pushing them
for some reason.

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:45.450
We couldn't resist...

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.660
Nuts-<i>chan</i>!

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:51.160
What are you doing, you clumsy cat?!

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:54.120
Give me a break--I slipped and fell!

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.660
I wonder if they're all right.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:17.080
I hope they're not getting blown away
by the wind or something...

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:20.580
I guess there's nothing to worry about.
They're all together.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.330
We are making an emergency stop.

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:25.790
Passengers who are standing:
please take care.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.080
--What is it?
--Out here in the middle of nowhere?

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.830
"Emergency stop--The Tokyo-Nagoya train has
made an emergency stop due to strong winds."
We are experiencing extremely
strong winds, and as a precaution,

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:34.120
"Emergency stop--The Tokyo-Nagoya train has
made an emergency stop due to strong winds."
all trains have been
brought to a stop.

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.540
Operation will resume as soon as
the winds calm down.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:41.870
"Heavy rains, strong winds, and high waves
expected across the nation"
All regions should be prepared for
heavy rains, strong winds, and high waves.

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:46.000
Especially in East and North Japan,
the rain will peak out by tomorrow morning

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.540
--and winds are expected to be strong.
--Aren't storms kinda exciting?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:54.200
You're too curious. To me, it's just
a noisy hinderance to my sunbathing.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:58.120
It's the sense of the
extraordinary that's exciting.

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:03.000
Going out on a day like this...
Is Shigure-<i>chan </i>okay?

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.700
A "Cat Meeting," was it?

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:09.870
To be exact, it's an offline meeting
for her online group of cat-lovers.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:12.450
She is running a bit late.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:15.160
She's travelling by car,
so she should be okay.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.080
I'm next.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.290
Come on, Chocola.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:45.700
Okay... This one!

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.370
Could be a decoy, so this one!

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:53.750
Which could be the trap
behind the trap, so this one!

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:55.370
Oh, no!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.410
Your expressions are too easy to read.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.040
I win.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.290
I lost again...

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.950
"Shigure"
"Call incoming"
"Block" "Pick up"

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.290
Yes, yes.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.750
Hello, Shigure?

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:23.450
I'm sorry, traffic is crazy, I probably
won't be able to make it home tonight.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.450
Why did it take you this long?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:29.040
We got too excited talking about cats...

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:34.790
Right... Well, we'll be fine, so you
go ahead and find a hotel or something.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:39.540
I will do that. Please take care
of things over there.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:45.870
That said, I don't know if I can make it
through the night without my cats...

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:51.040
So tonight, we're going to be alone at home.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.620
Is Shigure-<i>sama </i>going to be okay?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.620
The weather is getting pretty wild.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:06:01.200
What, "wild"?! All of a sudden, really?

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:04.410
There has to be an order to everything...

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:10.290
Oh, please be gentle, or not!

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.160
I'm going to go check on the ocean.

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.370
Stop that!

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:15.790
Hey, wanna get some pizza?

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.370
Stop that, too!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.580
But don't you want to enjoy the cheese?

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:22.540
"Melty rich cheese"
"Extra extra cheese special"
The stretchy, soft, rich cheese...?

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.160
--Um....
--Chocola kind of wants to...

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.580
--A blackout?
--Calm down, everyone!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:33.450
Oh, in the dark?! How indecent!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.040
Careful, Cacao!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.160
Why can't you see anything?

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.910
As a cat, doesn't that bother you?

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.500
Hey, Vanilla, stop scaring us.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.750
I thought my heart was going to pop out.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:50.410
What?! Hearts can pop out?!

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:01.250
We've run out of things to do.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.910
Wanna play word games?

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.450
How about a riddle contest?

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:08.910
Oh... Chocola is bad at riddles...

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:13.200
In that case, I have a great story to tell.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.200
A story?

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.870
Sounds fun.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.330
What is it like?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.620
And so it begins...

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:27.540
A long, long time ago, there were two cats.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:30.870
Hey, why am I a character in this?

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:32.790
Come on, never mind that.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:36.080
Huh, what is that sound?

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:40.410
It seems to be coming from that forest.

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:49.580
Surprise, in the forest
were cats having a party.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:52.620
--Hmm?
--What is going on here?

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:55.200
Well, well, it seems we have guests.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.080
What are you doing out here in the woods?

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.290
Don't worry about the little things.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:02.950
Parties are better with more attendees!

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:04.660
Have a sip.

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:06.200
Okay, just a sip.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.410
Oh, this is...

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:12.160
I've never had such delicious <i>matatabi </i>juice!

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:13.580
I know, right?

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:16.040
Please, have another.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.790
Thank you.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:23.330
The two joined the others and had
the best time of their lives.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:32.330
Not there...

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:42.290
What happened here?

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.910
Where did everyone go off to?

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:55.080
One... Two...

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:58.120
--Oh, there you are.
--Three... Four.... Five...

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:02.830
--That deep-fried tofu looks delicious.
--Three... Four.... Five...

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:04.120
--Six... Seven...

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:07.910
--Hmm? Were you one of the cats at the party?
--Six... Seven...

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:11.790
I knew it...

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:13.120
I'm missing one...

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.870
H-Hey!

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.700
Please be gentle with me...

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.410
This is no time for a nap!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.370
What's wrong?

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.290
Everything!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.700
A ghastly woman came out of a well...

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:35.120
That sounds terrifying.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:37.330
I was so scared!

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:45.950
Wow.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:48.830
That was pretty scary and fun.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:52.250
Y-Yes, very exciting...

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:53.830
Impressive, Vanilla!

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:56.200
Don't flatter me.

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.330
Did you enjoy it?

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.330
What was that?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.620
Just a little make-up trick.

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:13.660
Make-up? More like special effects...

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:16.120
Okay, next scary story--

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.700
Enough with that!

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:23.290
But I have to tell 100 stories
to summon the ghosts and ghouls.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.000
We don't want any!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.580
Oh, lights are back on.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:31.330
Come on, tell a happier story.

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:34.370
Then leave it to Chocola!

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.450
Chocola will tell a happy story!

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:53.080
Once upon a time, a pair of sister cats
went out on a picnic.

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:57.120
Chocola and me, close sisters... I like it.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:00.700
But! They got lost.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.950
They couldn't figure out the way home, but...

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.370
Wow!

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:14.330
They found a huge house made of sweets!

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:16.250
Delicious!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.080
Thank you.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:24.200
The sisters lived happily ever after
in the delicious house of sweets.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.790
The end.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:27.830
Huh?

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.870
Th-That's it?

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:33.700
Yes, the end! Wasn't that fun?

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:37.370
Well, it's not that it's fun or not fun, but...

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.700
Hmm...

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:46.000
If I may, to Chocola's beautiful story,
I shall add a fairy-tale sequel...

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:51.910
Several days passed as the sisters
enjoyed the house made of sweets.

00:11:57.450 --> 00:11:59.540
--Oh!
--I'm home.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:00.950
Welcome home!

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:05.660
Ugh, the boss was so annoying.
So tired from today.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.500
Good work.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:13.000
So would you like to eat first,
bathe first, or...

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:17.250
...me first?

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.620
Hey. That's enough.

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:21.160
Huh, why?

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.750
How is that fairy-tale-like?

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.080
It was just getting to the juicy part...

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:30.250
Fine then, a different story.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:35.580
Once upon a time, there lived a cat
who made a living chopping bamboo.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:38.790
Oh, this is astounding.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:41.290
Perhaps there is gold
or something in here.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:44.410
From the bamboo came...

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.040
...a ghastly woman.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:48.080
What is that?!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.410
A cheap one-shot gag.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:52.200
Not satisfied?

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.750
Then how about...

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:59.450
After spending a wonderful time in
the Dragon Palace, the cat returned home.

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:03.950
But when she opened the treasure
casket she received as a gift...

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:07.290
...out came a ghastly woman...

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:09.830
--That again!
--It's getting boring.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.160
Huh...

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:17.000
Fine then, I'll show you what
storytelling is really like.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:22.910
Like any other day, the
lumberjack was hard at work.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:28.580
The axe fell into the fountain.

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:32.500
Out came a ghastly woman--

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:35.370
Hey! Stop cutting in and altering my story!

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.200
That's not where this was going?

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:40.040
Of course not!

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:44.410
Anyway...

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:48.700
From the fountain came a goddess.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:54.790
Is the axe you dropped
this golden axe or this silver axe?

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:57.250
Both.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:01.500
I see, so it's neither-- What?

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.120
I dropped both.

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:04.120
Um...

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:06.080
I dropped both.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:10.660
Wait, um... Both?

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.830
If you're lying,
you're going to be in trouble...

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.750
Cut the nonsense and just hand them over.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:20.370
If you don't, I'll drain this whole fountain.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:24.450
"Vanilla & Chocola Diary"
I'm not going to make you
give them up for free.

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:29.910
I'll let you read my fantasy diary
detailing the intimate activities

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:32.040
between Chocola and me.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.370
Intimate activities, you say?

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:42.830
Oh, pistil to pistil...
This is a whole new world...

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:46.120
I... I...

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:50.290
I'm getting very moist!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:54.040
Thank you for this wonderful experience.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:57.290
You may take both the gold and silver axes.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.540
Score.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.830
And thus the lumberjack received the gold and--

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.200
Wait a second!

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:05.080
I'm not a pervert!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.120
Huh?

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:10.080
Your creative liberties have gone too far!

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.370
If you say so...

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:14.200
I suppose...

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:18.200
It should be dreamier and fairy-tail-like!

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:21.200
Well, in that case...

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:26.290
Once upon a time,
a lamp was found on the road.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.620
What's this?

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:29.370
Did someone drop this?

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:31.410
It's very dirty.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.450
Yeah.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.540
And from the lamp came...

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:37.580
A ghastly--

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:43.410
Came a fantastic genie.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.660
How may I serve you, Masters?

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:49.790
That's quite a creative leap.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.370
This master is awesome, too!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.450
What's this?

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:56.200
I will grant each of you one wish.

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.790
--Huh?
--Really?!
--Yay!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:01.370
Chocola wants to eat fish!
A very big fish!

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:02.580
Understood.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:08.620
Wow, such a huge...

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:10.950
...shark!

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.830
Why is there a shark in the river?

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:15.200
And how can it fly?

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.500
Please, your next wish.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:19.370
Well, in that case...

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:23.410
Um... So...

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.410
Please, anything you desire.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.790
I... ****!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:32.120
--What are you saying?!

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:34.580
--Try to at least be a little decent.
--What are you saying?!

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:37.540
That wasn't me, it's just part of the story...

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:40.290
What a bad excuse.

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:43.120
Okay, next. Let's keep going.

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:48.620
When she woke up,
she was in the land of the tiny people.

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:51.660
What's this...?

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:54.700
Princess, the giant has awakened!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.830
Has she come to invade my country?

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:01.660
Should we hang her or burn her?

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:04.450
Or shall we peel off each of her toenails...

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.450
Yay!

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:10.700
I'm the biggest!

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:13.000
The giant's rampage knew no end.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:17.500
The earth shattered beneath her feet,
and the demonic fire she breathed...

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:19.870
Hey. What kind of story is that?

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:24.000
I couldn't let the genie give you a wish.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:26.450
How is that my wish?

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:28.080
Don't you want to get bigger?

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.750
Not like that.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.870
That was a pretty good story.

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:33.950
How so?

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.290
Then what about this?

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:43.410
Matches... Please buy some matches.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:48.040
The girl tried her best to sell the matches,
but nobody would buy from her.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.540
I guess I won't be eating tonight either...

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:02.750
I know, I'll use these matches to stay warm.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:13.410
That looks very warm...

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:23.910
Oh, if I could join their intimate activities...

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:28.160
I was so close to getting inside...

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:36.700
How warm their cat-skin looks...

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:40.330
This story... it's...

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:42.700
making... me... moist...

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:49.120
Her expression appeared to be very happy.

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:53.620
May-<i>chan</i>, do you have a grudge
against me or something?

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:56.750
Nah, I just thought it was
the perfect role for you, so...

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:59.750
I don't appreciate being treated
like a pervert!

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:00.750
Ah...

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:03.750
Right! Then leave it to me for the next one.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:09.370
The princess ate the poison apple
and fell into a deep sleep.

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:15.410
When will the princess wake up?

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:18.250
How can she miss her three o'clock tea time?

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.410
It's not like her.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:22.700
We have to do something to wake her!

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.750
This is the best way!

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:27.620
Tickle, tickle, tickle...

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:31.500
No response. It's like she's a corpse.

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:32.830
How should we bury her?

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.250
She's not dead!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.410
--Is cremation better?
--I said she's not dead!

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:39.540
"Fish"
That didn't work either.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:41.290
How would it?!

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:46.330
That was kind of you.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:46.830
That scribble kind of ruins it.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.500
"Fish"
That scribble kind of ruins it.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.790
Wait, I know!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:57.790
The sleeping princess can be awakened
by a kiss from a loved one!

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:59.000
A kiss?!

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.540
Yes, also known as a smooch.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:06.330
A kiss, all of a sudden? I can't...

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.500
It's for the princess!
If that's what it takes...

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:12.000
--Huh?
--Yes, we have to do it.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:14.000
--Huh?
--Yes.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.080
I'll give away my first.

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:18.330
--Huh...?
--Let's do this!

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:22.620
W-Well, then I will, too...

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:24.080
Please go right on ahead.

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.200
Huh?!

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:50.080
As their lips slowly came closer...

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.200
Another blackout?

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:55.120
That scared me.

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:57.500
Chocola totally forgot about the storm!

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.910
What a bad moment to interrupt.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:03.000
What is that sound...?

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:05.160
During this storm...?

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:07.540
Is it coming closer...?

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:09.870
Hey! Stop with the bad jokes!

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:11.870
Was that...

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.910
The front door...?

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:16.870
Oh, it must be Vanilla again.

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:21.700
Just when we forget, right? You really
can't let you guard down against...

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.370
I'm right here.

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:24.500
Huh...

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:25.700
Why are you here?

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:27.660
--What do you mean, why?
--Oh, did you bring that for Chocola?

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:31.870
Thank you, Cacao. Now we're safe.

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:42.290
I didn't want to be alone,
so I walked home...

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:46.370
Hmm?

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:21.910
"Illustration by TakayaKi"
"Please watch again!"
